# Testing

## Framework

Vitest with Node environment. `DISABLE_EMAIL=true` and `NODE_ENV=test` set in `vitest.config.js`.

## Unit Tests

- Location: `test/services/`, `test/middleware/`
- Mock Prisma and external deps with `vi.mock()`
- Mocks auto-restored/cleared/reset between tests

## E2E Tests

- Location: `test/e2e/`
- Run against real Postgres via `scripts/test-e2e.sh`
- Run: `npm run test:e2e`

## Single File

```bash
npx vitest run test/services/auth-service.test.js
```
